cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SeedVR2 Upscale for Runpod Serverless
message: If you use this worker, please cite it and upstream SeedVR / SeedVR2.
type: software
authors:
  - name: prilojject
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/prilojject/runpod-seedvr2-upscale
url: https://prilojject.github.io/runpod-seedvr2-upscale/
abstract: >-
  A Runpod Serverless worker that batch-upscales videos and photos with
  official SeedVR2-3B (one-step diffusion, bfloat16 autocast, results.json).
keywords:
  - seedvr2
  - upscale
  - video-to-video
  - runpod
  - serverless
references:
